name longnamefilelist
category Package
revision 27889
shortdesc Tidy \listfiles with long file names
relocated 1
longdesc The package equips LaTeX's \listfiles command with an optional
longdesc argument for the number of characters in the longest base
longdesc filename. This way you get a neatly aligned file list even when
longdesc it contains files whose base names have more than 8 characters.
longdesc The package can be combined with the myfilist package as
longdesc explained in the documentation.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/longnamefilelist/longnamefilelist.sty
